WEBVTT

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.536
(Laughter)

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.136
Even our popular media hates humans.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.416
Watch television,

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:09.176
all the sci-fi shows are about how robots
are better and nicer than people.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:12.176
Even zombie shows --
what is every zombie show about?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.456
Some person, looking at the horizon
at some zombie going by,

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:18.376
and they zoom in on the person
and you see the person's face,

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.136
and you know what they're thinking:

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.896
"What's really the difference
between that zombie and me?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.456
He walks, I walk.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.496
He eats, I eat.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.800
He kills, I kill."